# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated code — committed
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated Go (buf), sqlc output, AND the Connect TS client (web/src/gen) are
# committed so fresh clone / CI / Docker builds work without the codegen tools
# (the web build runs pnpm, not buf). Regenerate with `make generate` and commit.

